.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

# Directories potentially created on remote AFP shares
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items

